# =============================================================================
# MapleSpike — Build & Push (DISABLED)
# =============================================================================
# ⚠️  DISABLED 2026-08-10: GHCR push is RETIRED post-flip (2026-07-10 systemic
# registry flip). The canonical registry is `nexus:5000/quill-<svc>` and images
# are pushed operator-side via `nix run .#push-images` (see ci.yml + ADR 0007 +
# docs/GHCR-CLEANUP.md).
#
# If this workflow ran it would push `:latest` + version-tagged images to the
# retired ghcr.io/reverb256/quill/<svc> registry — the exact drift this repo
# collapsed in the 2026-07-10 flip. Keep disabled.
#
# To restore when GHCR push is needed again:
#   - swap the registry back to ghcr.io
#   - re-add docker/login-action with a PAT
#   - rename this file back to build-push.yml
# =============================================================================
name: Build & Push (DISABLED - See header)

on:
  workflow_dispatch:

permissions:
  contents: read

jobs:
  disabled:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - name: Workflow Disabled
        run: |
          echo "❌ This workflow is disabled — GHCR push is retired (2026-07-10 flip)."
          echo "Use: nix run .#push-images  (pushes to nexus:5000/quill-<svc>)"
          exit 1
